{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119119","id":3609690756,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7XJ4KE","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119119","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119119.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119119.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119119","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119119/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119119/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119119/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8c62ff27f582839ccf8abb98f7c738ae321803c3","number":119119,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Allow building Web platform with C#/.NET module enabled","user":{"login":"AndresFpdhi","id":135043859,"node_id":"U_kgDOCAybEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135043859?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi","html_url":"https://github.com/AndresFpdhi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\r\n\r\nDeclares the Web platform as supporting the `mono` module so that\r\n`scons platform=web module_mono_enabled=yes` no longer aborts in\r\n`modules/mono/config.py` before any C++ compiles.\r\n\r\nThis is a **build-system unblock only**. C#/.NET exports to Web are\r\nstill gated at the editor level — the runtime hosting, exporter\r\nchanges, and template variants required for functional C# web exports\r\nare not part of this PR. The export-time error message is updated to\r\nreflect that support is in development rather than directing users\r\nback to Godot 3.\r\n\r\nThis is intended as a small, low-risk first step that unblocks\r\nparallel work on the runtime side without committing to any specific\r\nruntime-hosting design.\r\n\r\nRefs #70796\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n- `platform/web/detect.py`: add `\"supported\": [\"mono\"]` to `get_flags()`\r\n  (mirrors the pattern used by Android, iOS, macOS, Windows, Linux).\r\n- `modules/mono/build_scripts/mono_configure.py`: remove four\r\n  commented-out platform-detection lines that have been dead since the\r\n  .NET rewrite.\r\n- `platform/web/export/export_plugin.cpp`: replace the \"Use Godot 3\"\r\n  message with copy that signals work-in-progress.\r\n\r\n## What this enables\r\n\r\n- `scons platform=web target=template_{debug,release} module_mono_enabled=yes`\r\n  succeeds.\r\n- Non-C# Web exports are unaffected (the .NET runtime is never\r\n  initialized in non-editor builds without the `dotnet` feature).\r\n- Editor builds for Web remain rejected as before\r\n  (`module_supports_tools_on(env[\"platform\"])` still returns false).\r\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6051509301,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaLK0NQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/spam","name":"spam","description":"","color":"E94A26","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-04-30T15:05:49Z","updated_at":"2026-04-30T16:43:26Z","closed_at":"2026-04-30T16:43:20Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c2477fc6b7c75f6e36700bcf2173bb74102b5667","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"AndresFpdhi:web-mono-buildable","ref":"web-mono-buildable","repo":null,"sha":"8c62ff27f582839ccf8abb98f7c738ae321803c3","user":{"login":"AndresFpdhi","id":135043859,"node_id":"U_kgDOCAybEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135043859?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi","html_url":"https://github.com/AndresFpdhi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndresFpdhi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},"base":{"label":"godotengine:master","ref":"master","repo":{"id":15634981,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxNTYzNDk4MQ==","name":"godot","full_name":"godotengine/godot","owner":{"login":"godotengine","id":6318500,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjYzMTg1MDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6318500?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/godotengine","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/godotengine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.